  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Conservation of linear momentum</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using work energy theorem</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>",
